___NOTES___

Created for the consent product's Google Consent Mode CMP Partner Program
submission (cmppartnerprogram.withgoogle.com). Skips writing ___TESTS___
scenarios by request — add them before Community Template Gallery submission
if you want CI coverage; an empty scenarios array is valid and Google's own
review does not require pre-written tests.

Storage key design: reads a single fixed key ("cosmoops_consent") rather than
a per-site one, matching how Cookiebot's own official template reads one
fixed "CookieConsent" cookie name across every install instead of a
per-customer name. This requires src/lib/embed/generate-banner-script.ts to
mirror each consent decision into that flat key (in addition to its existing
siteId-scoped key, which the consent dashboard's own multi-site Test tab
still needs) — see the SHARED_STORAGE_KEY comment there. Still worth
double-checking the access_local_storage permission block against Tag
Manager's own Template Editor before Gallery submission, as with any
hand-authored permission JSON, but there's no per-field binding to resolve
here anymore.
